Implemented and committed `sos_1`, `sos_4`, `sos_13`, `sos_57`, `sos_97`, `sos_120`, `sos_201`, `sos_226`, `sos_245`, and `sos_257` in `/workspace/cards/sos/`, along with per-card SOS tests and the engine support those cards needed.

The engine additions now cover prepared spell copies and token color surfaces, paid-mana tracking and delayed main-phase triggers, deterministic coin flips and turn skipping, miracle casting windows, non-evergreen keyword exposure, shared granted cost reductions, and restricted mana spending rules. I left the existing `run_manifest.json` modification untouched.

